Для добавления Serilog в .NET проект выполните:
1. Установите пакеты: `dotnet add package Serilog`, `dotnet add package Serilog.Sinks.Console`, `dotnet add package Serilog.Sinks.File`
2. В Program.cs добавьте:
```csharp
using Serilog;

Log.Logger = new LoggerConfiguration()
    .WriteTo.Console()
    .WriteTo.File("logs/log.txt", rollingInterval: RollingInterval.Day)
    .CreateLogger();

try
{
    Log.Information("Starting application");
    // your code
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    Log.Fatal(ex, "Application terminated unexpectedly");
}
finally
{
    Log.CloseAndFlush();
}
```

Чтобы настроить Serilog через appsettings.json:
1. Установите пакет `Serilog.Settings.Configuration`
2. В appsettings.json добавьте:
```json
{
  "Serilog": {
    "Using": ["Serilog.Sinks.Console", "Serilog.Sinks.File"],
    "MinimumLevel": "Information",
    "WriteTo": [
      { "Name": "Console" },
      { "Name": "File", "Args": { "path": "logs/log.txt", "rollingInterval": "Day" } }
    ]
  }
}
```
3. В Program.cs прочитайте:
```csharp
Log.Logger = new LoggerConfiguration()
    .ReadFrom.Configuration(builder.Configuration)
    .CreateLogger();
```

Создайте класс, реализующий `ILogEventEnricher`, например:
```csharp
public class CustomDateEnricher : ILogEventEnricher
{
    public void Enrich(LogEvent logEvent, ILogEventPropertyFactory propertyFactory)
    {
        logEvent.AddPropertyIfAbsent(propertyFactory.CreateProperty("CustomDate", DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss")));
    }
}
```
Затем при конфигурации:
```csharp
Log.Logger = new LoggerConfiguration()
    .Enrich.With(new CustomDateEnricher())
    .WriteTo.Console(outputTemplate: "{Timestamp} [{Level}] {CustomDate} {Message}{NewLine:1}{Exception:1}")
    .CreateLogger();
```

